OL,3,GNEWSAMissing fishing boat Kilda
OL,4,Arecovered from waters off Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fishing boat that went missing near
OL,7,Fthe Isle of Lewis a month ago has been
OL,8,Frecovered after it was spotted
OL,9,Fsemi-submerged in the North Sea off
OL,10,FOrkney.
OL,12,FThree men were on board the Kilda when
OL,13,Fit disappeared on 13 October.
OL,15,FThe body of crew member Douglas Craigie
OL,16,Fwas found by search teams the following
OL,17,Fday but two other men - Norman Murray
OL,18,Fand Murdo Morrison - remain unaccounted
OL,19,Ffor.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
