OL,3,GNEWSAMissing fishing boat Kilda
OL,4,Arecovered from waters off Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wreck was spotted about 50 miles
OL,7,F(80km) east of Orkney on Wednesday
OL,8,Fmorning, and a specialist vessel
OL,9,Frecovered it on Thursday before
OL,10,Fbringing it to Kirkwall.
